{% /card %}

{% card title="Binary space partition rooms" id="bsp" kind="Generator" %}
Rooms placed in ever-smaller parts of the map, so they come out better spaced than random rooms {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s61" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s62" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s63" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s64" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-slides/pdf#p7" /%}.

Stage `bsp`. The talk’s demo: `c02-bsprooms`.

{% part title="The rule" %}
```text
start a list with one rectangle and its four quarters
repeat for a fixed number of attempts:
    pick any rectangle on the list
    try a room near its top-left corner
    if it fits: carve it, and add that rectangle's four quarters to the list
sort and join the rooms, as random rooms are
```

The talk describes halving the map, then each half, until a piece is about the size of a room {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s66" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s67" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s68" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s69" /%}. Its demo is looser: it cuts into quarters, keeps every rectangle it has cut on its list, and quarters a rectangle again each time a room lands in it {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L41-L55" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L86-L121" /%}.
{% /part %}

{% part title="Step through it" %}
{% interactive id="lab" caption="Step through BSP rooms: seed 1, 80 by 50 tiles. Change the seed or a control and the map is built again." params={mode: "card", stage: "bsp", demos: ["c02-bsprooms"]} %}
{% steps %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c02-0001-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c02-0001-dark.png" alt="BSP rooms, seed 1: the map at step 1 of 45." key="bsp.subdivide" at=1 of=45 %}
The demo starts its list with one rectangle inside the map’s edge and that rectangle’s four quarters {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L24-L29" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L87-L111" /%}. Quarters shown so far: {% value %}0{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c02-0006-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c02-0006-dark.png" alt="BSP rooms, seed 1: the map at step 6 of 45." key="bsp.add" at=6 of=45 %}
An attempt picks any rectangle on the list and tries a room near its top-left corner {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L43-L44" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L114-L136" /%}. The room is carved only if every tile within two of it is still solid and inside the map’s outer ring, and then the rectangle it came from is quartered again {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L45-L52" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L86-L112" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L138-L174" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. It is room {% value %}1{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c02-0025-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c02-0025-dark.png" alt="BSP rooms, seed 1: the map at step 25 of 45." key="bsp.add" at=25 of=45 %}
An attempt picks any rectangle on the list and tries a room near its top-left corner {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L43-L44" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L114-L136" /%}. The room is carved only if every tile within two of it is still solid and inside the map’s outer ring, and then the rectangle it came from is quartered again {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L45-L52" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L86-L112" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L138-L174" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. It is room {% value %}20{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c02-0026-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c02-0026-dark.png" alt="BSP rooms, seed 1: the map at step 26 of 45." key="rooms.sort" at=26 of=45 %}
The rooms are sorted by their left edge, the order they will be joined in {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c01-rooms/src/main.rs#L57-L69" /%}. Rooms to join: {% value %}20{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c02-0027-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c02-0027-dark.png" alt="BSP rooms, seed 1: the map at step 27 of 45." key="rooms.corridor" at=27 of=45 %}
A corridor joins this room’s center to the center of the room before it: one run across and one up or down, in an order a coin flip picks {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c01-rooms/src/main.rs#L67-L78" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c01-rooms/src/main.rs#L85-L101" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s57" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s58" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. It is corridor {% value %}1{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c02-0045-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c02-0045-dark.png" alt="BSP rooms, seed 1: the map at step 45 of 45." key="rooms.corridor" at=45 of=45 %}
A corridor joins this room’s center to the center of the room before it: one run across and one up or down, in an order a coin flip picks {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c01-rooms/src/main.rs#L67-L78" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c01-rooms/src/main.rs#L85-L101" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s57" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s58" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. It is corridor {% value %}19{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% /steps %}

On the command line: `map-lab build recipes/c02-bsprooms.json`.
{% /interactive %}
{% /part %}

{% part title="Controls" %}
- `attempts` (1 to 5,000; the talk’s: `240`) {% own /%}. How many times a rectangle is picked and a room tried. The demo’s counter goes up on every attempt, whether or not the room fits {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L41-L55" /%}.
{% /part %}

