Of 240 attempts, 18 place a room at the median {% own-run values="c02.rooms.median" /%}. The talk says of its animation that there are no rejections {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s70" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s71" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s72" /%}. The demo records a frame only for a room that fits, so the attempts that fail are never shown {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c02-bsprooms/src/main.rs#L41-L55" /%}. Against random rooms it places 18 rooms to 13 and opens 0.233 of the map to 0.162 {% own-run values="c02.rooms.median c01.rooms.median c02.floor_share.median c01.floor_share.median" /%}.
{% /part %}

