The rule says nothing about joining the caves up {% own /%}. A map has 17 regions at the median and never fewer than 6 {% own-run values="c03.regions.median c03.regions.min" /%}. The map has no start and exit of its own, so its path is measured between [our probe’s](#our-definitions) two points, and on 72 of 200 seeds they lie in different caves {% own-run values="c03.path.nulls" /%}.
{% /part %}

