The talk’s first big use for Dijkstra maps is on a map like this one, which can leave chunks that can’t be reached {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s209" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s210" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s211" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s212" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s213" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s222" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s223" /%}.
