{% /card %}

{% card title="Drunkard’s walk" id="drunkard" kind="Generator" %}
A digger staggers at random through solid rock, and more follow until enough of the map is open {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s87" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s88" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s89" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s90" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s91" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s92" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s93" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s94" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s95" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s96" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s97" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-slides/pdf#p11" /%}.

Stage `drunkard`. The talk’s demo: `c04-drunkard`.

{% part title="The rule" %}
```text
start solid; the first digger starts at the center
a digger steps in a random direction and digs where it lands,
    until it leaves the map or runs out of steps
while less than a share of the map is open:
    start another digger on a random open tile
```

The talk has each new digger spawn somewhere within the open map, and stops when a third of the map is open {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s95" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s96" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s97" /%}.
{% /part %}

{% part title="Step through it" %}
{% interactive id="lab" caption="Step through Drunkard’s walk: seed 1, 80 by 50 tiles. Change the seed or a control and the map is built again." params={mode: "card", stage: "drunkard", demos: ["c04-drunkard"]} %}
{% steps %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c04-0001-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c04-0001-dark.png" alt="Drunkard’s walk, seed 1: the map at step 1 of 53." key="drunkard.solid" at=1 of=53 %}
The map starts solid {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L17-L19" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s87" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c04-0002-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c04-0002-dark.png" alt="Drunkard’s walk, seed 1: the map at step 2 of 53." key="drunkard.dig" at=2 of=53 %}
A digger steps in a random direction and digs the tile it lands on, again and again, until it steps off the map or runs out of steps {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L54-L76" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s90" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s91" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s92" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s93" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s94" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s95" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. The first starts at the center and each later one on a random open tile {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L21-L22" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L25-L47" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s95" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s96" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. This is digger {% value %}1{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c04-0027-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c04-0027-dark.png" alt="Drunkard’s walk, seed 1: the map at step 27 of 53." key="drunkard.dig" at=27 of=53 %}
A digger steps in a random direction and digs the tile it lands on, again and again, until it steps off the map or runs out of steps {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L54-L76" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s90" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s91" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s92" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s93" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s94" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s95" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. The first starts at the center and each later one on a random open tile {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L21-L22" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L25-L47" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s95" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s96" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. This is digger {% value %}26{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c04-0053-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c04-0053-dark.png" alt="Drunkard’s walk, seed 1: the map at step 53 of 53." key="drunkard.dig" at=53 of=53 %}
A digger steps in a random direction and digs the tile it lands on, again and again, until it steps off the map or runs out of steps {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L54-L76" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s90" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s91" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s92" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s93" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s94" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s95" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. The first starts at the center and each later one on a random open tile {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L21-L22" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L25-L47" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s95" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s96" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. This is digger {% value %}52{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% /steps %}

On the command line: `map-lab build recipes/c04-drunkard.json`.
{% /interactive %}
{% /part %}

{% part title="Controls" %}
- `lifetime` (1 to 100,000; the talk’s: `200`) {% own /%}. How many steps a digger takes. The demo stops a digger once its step count is over 200 {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L54-L76" /%}.
- `floor_divisor` (1 to 20; the talk’s: `3`) {% own /%}. Diggers keep coming until one over this number of the map’s tiles is open: a third, in the demo {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c04-drunkard/src/main.rs#L25" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s96" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s97" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}.
{% /part %}

{% part title="What it produces, measured" %}
Seeds 0 to 199, our own runs: the median, then the range 8 of 10 seeds fall in {% own-run values="table.measured.drunkard" /%}.

{% table label="Measured traits: Drunkard’s walk" rowheads=true key=true %}
* Trait
* Drunkard’s walk (c04)
* This map
---
