* 0.338, 0.334 to 0.345 {% mark p10=0.334 median=0.338 p90=0.345 unit="seeds" to=1 trait="floor_share" series="c04-drunkard" /%}
* {% now trait="floor_share" digits=3 /%}
---
* [Regions](#our-definitions)
* 1, 1 to 1 {% mark p10=1 median=1 p90=1 unit="seeds" to=60 trait="regions" series="c04-drunkard" /%}
* {% now trait="regions" digits=0 /%}
---
* [Dead ends](#our-definitions)
* 24, 17 to 32 {% mark p10=17 median=24 p90=32 unit="seeds" to=140 trait="dead_ends" series="c04-drunkard" /%}
* {% now trait="dead_ends" digits=0 /%}
---
* [Corridor ratio](#our-definitions)
* 0.053, 0.037 to 0.075 {% mark p10=0.037 median=0.053 p90=0.075 unit="seeds" to=0.4 trait="corridor_ratio" series="c04-drunkard" /%}
