* Trait
* DLA, walking (c05)
* DLA, attractor (c06)
* DLA, symmetric (c07)
* This map
---
* [Floor share](#our-definitions)
* 0.333, 0.333 to 0.333 {% mark p10=0.333 median=0.333 p90=0.333 unit="seeds" to=1 trait="floor_share" series="c05-dla" /%}
* 0.333, 0.333 to 0.333 {% mark p10=0.333 median=0.333 p90=0.333 unit="seeds" to=1 trait="floor_share" series="c06-dla-attractor" /%}
* 0.333, 0.333 to 0.334 {% mark p10=0.333 median=0.333 p90=0.334 unit="seeds" to=1 trait="floor_share" series="c07-dla-symmetry" /%}
* {% now trait="floor_share" digits=3 /%}
---
* [Regions](#our-definitions)
* 1, 1 to 1 {% mark p10=1 median=1 p90=1 unit="seeds" to=60 trait="regions" series="c05-dla" /%}
* 26, 19 to 34 {% mark p10=19 median=26 p90=34 unit="seeds" to=60 trait="regions" series="c06-dla-attractor" /%}
* 25, 17 to 35 {% mark p10=17 median=25 p90=35 unit="seeds" to=60 trait="regions" series="c07-dla-symmetry" /%}
* {% now trait="regions" digits=0 /%}
---
* [Dead ends](#our-definitions)
