* 63, 55 to 75 {% mark p10=55 median=63 p90=75 unit="seeds" to=140 trait="dead_ends" series="c06-dla-attractor" /%}
* 64, 50 to 80 {% mark p10=50 median=64 p90=80 unit="seeds" to=140 trait="dead_ends" series="c07-dla-symmetry" /%}
* {% now trait="dead_ends" digits=0 /%}
---
* [Corridor ratio](#our-definitions)
* 0.217, 0.196 to 0.242 {% mark p10=0.196 median=0.217 p90=0.242 unit="seeds" to=0.4 trait="corridor_ratio" series="c05-dla" /%}
* 0.120, 0.103 to 0.136 {% mark p10=0.103 median=0.12 p90=0.136 unit="seeds" to=0.4 trait="corridor_ratio" series="c06-dla-attractor" /%}
* 0.120, 0.098 to 0.147 {% mark p10=0.098 median=0.12 p90=0.147 unit="seeds" to=0.4 trait="corridor_ratio" series="c07-dla-symmetry" /%}
* {% now trait="corridor_ratio" digits=3 /%}
---
* [Path](#our-definitions)
* 88, 79 to 95 {% mark p10=79 median=88 p90=95 unit="seeds" to=290 trait="path" series="c05-dla" /%}
* 60, 56 to 66 (none on 44) {% mark p10=56 median=60 p90=66 unit="seeds" to=290 trait="path" series="c06-dla-attractor" /%}
* 58, 54 to 64 (none on 29) {% mark p10=54 median=58 p90=64 unit="seeds" to=290 trait="path" series="c07-dla-symmetry" /%}
* {% now trait="path" digits=0 /%}
{% /table %}

- **Talk says:** the simple version is very winding, and guaranteed to be contiguous {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s109" /%}.
- **Walk:** both hold. 1 region on every seed; 113 dead ends at the median, vs cellular automata’s 67 {% own-run values="c05.regions.max c05.dead_ends.median c03.dead_ends.median" /%}.
- **Attractor, symmetric:** not contiguous. 26 and 25 regions at the median; never fewer than 13 and 5 {% own-run values="c06.regions.median c07.regions.median c06.regions.min c07.regions.min" /%}.
  - **Why:** their particles follow a Bresenham line to the center {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c06-dla-attractor/src/main.rs#L56-L60" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c07-dla-symmetry/src/main.rs#L56-L60" /%}. A diagonal step on that line leaves the dug tile touching the cave only at a corner, and walking is four-way {% own /%}.
{% /part %}

