- **No cap in the talk’s code:** the simple version’s walk runs until it finds open floor {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c05-dla/src/main.rs#L55-L80" /%}.
- **Ours has a cap:** 0 of these seeds reach it {% own-run values="c05.fails.guard-hit" /%}.
{% /part %}

{% part title="What it combines with" %}
None of the talk’s demos runs it with another stage {% own /%}.

- **Erosion:** the talk also fires particles at a finished map, which its slide calls DLA for erosion {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s191" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s192" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s193" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-slides/pdf#p21" /%}. See [erosion by aggregation](#dla-erode).
{% /part %}

