The overworld’s land is not one piece: 4 regions at the median, with water between them {% own-run values="c11.regions.median" /%}. A map at the median is 0.495 water, 0.377 grass and 0.122 mountain {% own-run values="c11.water.median c11.grass.median c11.mountain.median" /%}. The zoom’s last frame is a small window of the noise, and what it holds varies widely: its floor share runs from 0.000 to 0.886 over the seeds {% own-run values="c12.floor_share.min c12.floor_share.max" /%}. The height map is all floor, so its numbers say only how big the map is {% own /%}.
{% /part %}

