Erosion starts from a finished map: in the talk’s demo, random rooms joined by corridors {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c08-dla-erosion/src/main.rs#L21-L83" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s191" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s192" /%}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c08-0032-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c08-0032-dark.png" alt="Rooms, eroded, seed 1: the map at step 32 of 531." key="dla-erode.particle" at=32 of=531 %}
A particle starts on a random open tile and steps at random until it stands on rock. That one tile of rock is dug {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c08-dla-erosion/src/main.rs#L86-L128" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s192" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s193" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. This is particle {% value %}1{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c08-0281-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c08-0281-dark.png" alt="Rooms, eroded, seed 1: the map at step 281 of 531." key="dla-erode.particle" at=281 of=531 %}
A particle starts on a random open tile and steps at random until it stands on rock. That one tile of rock is dug {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c08-dla-erosion/src/main.rs#L86-L128" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s192" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s193" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. This is particle {% value %}250{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c08-0531-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c08-0531-dark.png" alt="Rooms, eroded, seed 1: the map at step 531 of 531." key="dla-erode.particle" at=531 of=531 %}
A particle starts on a random open tile and steps at random until it stands on rock. That one tile of rock is dug {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c08-dla-erosion/src/main.rs#L86-L128" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s192" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s193" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}. This is particle {% value %}500{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% /steps %}

On the command line: `map-lab build recipes/c08-dla-erosion.json`.
{% /interactive %}
{% /part %}

{% part title="Controls" %}
- `iterations` (0 to 100,000; the talk’s: `500`) {% own /%}. How many particles are fired, each digging one tile {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c08-dla-erosion/src/main.rs#L86-L128" /%}.
{% /part %}

