{% part title="What it combines with" %}
The talk’s demos that run it with other stages {% own /%}:

- [combine(bsp / cellular) → prefab](#) `c09`: two maps combined, with a prefab
{% /part %}

{% part title="Checked against the talk’s code" %}
Our stage against the talk’s own code, each run on seeds 0 to 199 and [measured the same way](#is-this-the-talks-technique) {% own-run values="list.checked.combine" /%}:

- `c09-combination`: 7 of 8 traits consistent with the talk’s own code. **Corridor ratio differs**: ours 0.139 on average, the talk’s 0.166.

The corridor ratio differs because of the prefab down the middle: ours is a hall of our own design, standing in for the talk’s layout, which we don’t copy {% own /%}.
{% /part %}

{% /card %}

{% card title="Prefabs" id="prefab" kind="Shaping" %}
A piece of map designed by hand, dropped into a generated one {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s198" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s199" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s200" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-slides/pdf#p22" /%}.

Stage `prefab`. The talk’s demos: `c14-not-a-trap`, `c15-still-not-a-trap`.

{% part title="The rule" %}
```text
in a room:     pick random rooms until one is big enough; stamp it at the room's center
on open floor: pick random spots until the whole prefab lies on floor; stamp it there
down the middle: stamp it over the center columns of the map
```

With rooms, the talk’s way is to go through the room list for a room bigger than the prefab {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s203" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s204" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s205" /%}. On a map without rooms it picks random locations and looks whether the prefab will fit {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s205" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s206" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s207" /%}.
{% /part %}

{% part title="Step through it" %}
{% interactive id="lab" caption="Step through Vault in a room, Vault on open floor: seed 1, 80 by 50 tiles. Change the seed or a control and the map is built again." params={mode: "card", stage: "prefab", demos: ["c14-not-a-trap", "c15-still-not-a-trap"]} %}
{% steps %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c14-0030-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c14-0030-dark.png" alt="Vault in a room, seed 1: the map at step 30 of 32." at=30 of=32 %}
The map before the next step.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c14-0031-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c14-0031-dark.png" alt="Vault in a room, seed 1: the map at step 31 of 32." key="prefab.show" at=31 of=32 %}
The prefab on its own: two treasure tiles ringed by traps, inside a margin that is left as the map has it {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c14-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L86-L102" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c14-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L149-L155" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s200" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s201" /%}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c14-0032-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c14-0032-dark.png" alt="Vault in a room, seed 1: the map at step 32 of 32." key="prefab.placed" at=32 of=32 %}
The prefab is stamped where it fits: at the center of a room big enough for it, or on a patch of open floor {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c14-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L104-L124" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c15-still-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L41-L67" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s203" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s204" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s205" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s206" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c15-0013-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c15-0013-dark.png" alt="Vault on open floor, seed 1: the map at step 13 of 13." key="prefab.no-place" at=13 of=13 %}
No place was found for the prefab {% own /%}. The talk’s loops end only when the prefab has been placed, so its code would still be looking {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c14-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L104-L124" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c15-still-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L41-L67" /%}. Ours stops and records the seed as a failure {% own /%}.
{% /step %}
{% /steps %}

On the command line: `map-lab build recipes/c14-not-a-trap.json`, `map-lab build recipes/c15-still-not-a-trap.json`.
{% /interactive %}
{% /part %}

{% part title="Controls" %}
- `shape` (`vault`, `spine`; the talk’s: `vault`) {% own /%}. `vault` is the talk’s treasure ringed by traps {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c14-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L86-L102" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c14-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L149-L155" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s200" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s201" /%}. `spine` is our stand-in for the fortifications the talk’s combined map gets: a hall of our own design {% own /%}.
- `place` (`room`, `open-area`, `center`; the talk’s: `room` in `c14`, `open-area` in `c15`) {% own /%}. `room` puts it at the center of a random room that is big enough {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c14-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L104-L124" /%}, `open-area` wherever a random spot has floor under all of it {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c15-still-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L41-L67" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L12-L16" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/backend/src/lib.rs#L54-L65" /%}, and `center` down the middle of the map, as the combined map’s is {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c09-combination/src/main.rs#L116-L133" /%}.
{% /part %}

