With 50 attempts the map places 21 rooms at the median, and its route is 180.5 steps against the caves’ 102 {% own-run values="c21.rooms.median c21.path.median c18.path.median" /%}. Corridors join the rooms in left-to-right order, not by the shortest way {% own /%}.
